                "description": "Fusion 25-V6, Flat Iron Knob with El Tovar Round Rose - The Flat Iron Knob with El Tovar Round Rose has a historic feel not only because of its classic shape but also because it is available in 3 vintage finishes: antique relic pewter, medium relic bronze, and dark relic bronze. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions that will fit either a 2-3/8 inch or a 2-3/4 inch backset. It will adjust to door thicknesses from 1-1/4 inches to 2 inches.",
